# Security — Advanced

Enable when rule level includes `advanced`. Base `security.mdc` still applies.

- Threat notes for auth, uploads, admin, and payment-related flows from the concept
- Security headers (CSP, etc.) appropriate to the stack/host
- Session fixation / rotation on login; refresh-token rotation when using JWT refresh
- Privilege checks on every object (IDOR): user can only access own resources unless role allows
- Dependency/audit cadence when the project has a package lockfile
- Secrets scanning in CI/hooks; never commit proof files or dumps
